---
import { SITE } from '../config/site';

const principles = [
  { no: '01', sanskrit: 'Vasudhaiva Kutumbakam', gloss: 'The world is one family.' },
  { no: '02', sanskrit: 'Sarvajana Hitaya, Sarvajana Sukhaya', gloss: 'For the welfare and the happiness of all.' },
  { no: '03', sanskrit: 'Advaita', gloss: 'Non-duality: beneath the surface, we are not separate.' },
];
---

<section class="section vision" id="vision" data-accent="lilac">
  <div class="wrap wrap-wide reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Vision and values</p>

    <p class="statement">Science is worth doing when it <span class="hl">changes lives.</span></p>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        She believes science should change the world, in small increments or in leaps, and that
        social impact is the whole point. Progress that reaches only a few is not yet finished.
      </p>
      <p>
        That belief shapes who she stands with. She is a committed advocate for women, for the
        LGBTQ+ community, and for people pushed to the margins, in the lab and beyond it. She
        wants the people around her to grow, and she measures her own work partly by how much it
        helps them.
      </p>
      <p>
        Her longer horizon reaches home. She hopes to help build India into a force for global
        good: a country whose science, talent, and care strengthen the whole world.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ul class="principles">
      {principles.map((p) => (
        <li class="principle">
          <span class="mono no">{p.no}</span>
          <span class="sanskrit" lang="sa">{p.sanskrit}</span>
          <span class="gloss">{p.gloss}</span>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>

    {SITE.venturesUrl && (
      <p class="ventures">
        Alongside her research, she is a founder working in regenerative medicine.{' '}
        <a href={SITE.venturesUrl} rel="noopener">See her ventures</a>.
      </p>
    )}
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .statement {
    font-size: var(--step-3);
    font-weight: 680;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.02;
    text-wrap: balance;
    max-width: 20ch;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-l);
  }
  .statement .hl {
    color: var(--accent-contrast);
    background: var(--accent-field);
    box-decoration-break: clone;
    -webkit-box-decoration-break: clone;
    padding: 0 0.12em;
    margin: 0 -0.02em;
  }

  .vision .prose { max-width: var(--measure); }

  .principles {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: var(--space-xl) 0 0;
    border-top: 1.5px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .principle {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2.5rem 1fr;
    gap: 0.2rem 1.4rem;
    padding: var(--space-m) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    align-items: baseline;
  }
  @media (min-width: 720px) {
    .principle { grid-template-columns: 3rem 22rem 1fr; }
  }
  .principle .no { color: var(--accent); }
  .sanskrit { font-style: italic; font-size: var(--step-1); color: var(--ink); }
  .gloss { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: var(--step-0); }

  .ventures { margin-top: var(--space-l); color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: var(--measure); }
</style>
